    "text": "<p>1) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NiCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><msub><mo>]</mo><mn>18</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dab3c1ac-d7c3-4cab-9eac-a91d2b5b5492-c2be5f44-3acd-4596-8ac7-89ebc2e3b31e-image.png\" style=\"width: 390px; height: 141px;\" /></p><p>2) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><msub><mo>]</mo><mn>18</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/32b7c705-1e1a-4bf1-b4b1-aaf73e336203-image.png\" style=\"width: 407px; height: 260px;\" /></p><p>3) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ni</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CO</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>4</mn></msub></math><br />CO<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo></math>Strong field ligand</p><p><img src=\"htt